OL,3,GNEWSA'Poodle Party' for dogs saved from
OL,4,Acrowded house
OL,5,
OL,6,FEight dogs who were among 250 found
OL,7,Fcrammed into one home have been
OL,8,Freunited with the RSPCA workers who
OL,9,Fcared for them.
OL,11,FThe animals, all poodle crosses, were
OL,12,Fdiscovered in an undisclosed property
OL,13,Fin January. Eighty-seven were rescued
OL,14,Fby the RSPCA, others were taken in by
OL,15,Fthe Dogs Trust.
OL,17,FOn Saturday, the West Norfolk RSPCA Eau
OL,18,FBrink rehoming centre, near King's
OL,19,FLynn, where the dogs had originally
OL,20,Fbeen taken, held a "Poodle party".
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
