OL,3,GNEWSA'Poodle Party' for dogs saved from
OL,4,Acrowded house
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the party-going canines, Rufus,
OL,7,Fhad been adopted by Karen and Glen Bix,
OL,8,Ffrom Aylsham. Karen Bix said Rufus had
OL,9,Fsettled in to their home and was "doing
OL,10,Freally well".
